### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/

### See which groups the bot knows about
GET http://localhost:8000/admin/groups
X-Admin-Key: change-me-to-something-random

### Push today's puzzle to every group NOW (uses your monthly message quota!)
POST http://localhost:8000/admin/push-daily
X-Admin-Key: change-me-to-something-random

### View a board image (replace with a real puzzle id)
GET http://localhost:8000/board/K69di.png
